# Orcrist, Goblin-cleaver: equipped creature gets +2/+2 and has trample, and when it deals combat damage to a player its
# controller chooses a creature type and gets a Treasure for each creature they control of that type. Turn one casts
# Ornithopter (a Thopter) and Orcrist off Sol Ring and a Mox; turn three equips Ornithopter, which attacks as a 2/4, and
# Bot1 chooses Thopter: one Thopter, one Treasure.

